  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Negotiated Partnership between&#xa0;ADRA New Zealand and MFAT to support healthier and more resilient rural communities in the Pacific and Southeast Asia, improving health, protection and economic resilience for women and girls, food and income security.&#xa0;ADRA are also strengthening climate change adaptation in water, sanitation and hygiene facilities and infrastructure.</narrative>
